# Typed by hand from M. Pani et al., J. Solid State Chem. 210 (2014) 45-52, doi:10.1016/j.jssc.2013.10.046:
# coordinates of the isotypic CeNi6Si6 (Table 2b, P4/nbm origin choice 1) with La on the Ce sites, and the
# LaNi6Si6 cell of Table 3 (a 0.78300 nm, c 1.12377 nm). The paper gives no coordinates for LaNi6Si6 itself.
# CeNi6Si6 distances from these coordinates reproduce Table 4a exactly (the paper's Ce1/Ce2 labels are swapped
# relative to 2a/2b). M = Ni0.5Si0.5 on 16n as published. Not from an ICDD or ICSD record.

